{"id": "85906", "name": "פתרון tan θ = 1 בתחום נתון (באנגלית)", "defaultgrade": 1, "penalty": 0.1, "options": {"multiplicationsign": "dot", "complexno": "i", "matrixparens": "[", "inversetrig": "cos-1", "logicsymbol": "lang", "sqrtsign": true}, "nhints": 0, "questiontext": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px\"><p>Given that \\(\\theta\\) lies in the range</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ {{CT:0}}&lt;\\theta&lt;{{CT:1}}\\mbox{,} \\]</p><p>and that \\(\\tan \\left(\\theta\\right) = 1\\).</p></div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:14px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><div style=\"background:#FAF9FB;border-radius:8px;padding:10px;direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate\">\\(\\theta=\\) [[input:ans1]]</div><div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"direction:ltr;text-align:center;unicode-bidi:isolate;margin-top:6px\">[[validation:ans1]]</div><p style=\"font-size:0.92em;margin:8px 0 0\">You may enter \\(\\pi\\) as <code dir=\"ltr\">pi</code> or <code dir=\"ltr\">%pi</code>.</p></div></div>", "generalfeedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\" style=\"max-width:980px;font-family:Arial;line-height:1.7\"><div style=\"background:#F4F1F5;border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:12px 16px;margin-bottom:12px\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Outline:</b> Write down all solutions of \\(\\tan\\theta=1\\), then pick the one in the given range.</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 1 — All solutions of the equation</b><br>Since \\(\\tan\\left(\\frac{\\pi}{4}\\right)=1\\) and the tangent has period \\(\\pi\\). Given that \\(\\tan \\left(\\theta\\right) = 1\\) then \\(\\theta= {{CT:2}} + {{CT:3}}\\) for some integer \\(m\\).</div><div style=\"border:1px solid #D9D1DD;border-radius:12px;padding:14px 16px;margin:12px 0;overflow-x:auto\"><b style=\"color:#4b1f6f\">Step 2 — The solution in the range</b><br>Setting \\(m={{CT:4}}\\) we see that<p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"text-align:center\">\\[ \\theta={{CT:5}}+{{CT:3}}={{CT:6}} \\]</p>lies in the range \\({{CT:0}}&lt;\\theta&lt;{{CT:1}}\\). The neighbouring solutions differ from it by \\(\\pm\\pi\\), and both lie outside this range, so this is the only answer.</div></div>", "specificfeedback": "<p>[[feedback:Result]]</p>", "prtcorrect": "<p><span class=\"correct\">Correct answer, well done.</span></p>", "prtpartiallycorrect": "<p><span class=\"partially\">Your answer is partially correct.</span></p>", "prtincorrect": "<p><span class=\"incorrect\">Incorrect answer.</span></p>", "inputs": [{"name": "ans1", "type": "algebraic", "boxsize": 20, "insertstars": 0, "forbidfloat": true, "forbidwords": "", "allowwords": "", "mustverify": true, "showvalidation": 1, "syntaxhint": "", "syntaxattribute": 0, "options": "", "requirelowestterms": true}], "prts": [{"name": "Result", "value": 1, "autosimplify": true, "feedbackstyle": 1, "feedbackvariables": "", "firstnode": 0, "nodes": [{"name": 0, "answertest": "AlgEquiv", "sans": "ans1", "tans": "theta", "testoptions": null, "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 1, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "GEO-TFN-TRUE", "feedback": ""}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": 1, "answernote": "GEO-TFN-FALSE", "feedback": ""}}, {"name": 1, "answertest": "NumRelative", "sans": "tan(ans1)", "tans": "1", "testoptions": "0.05", "quiet": false, "on_true": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "WRONG_RANGE", "feedback": "<div dir=\"ltr\">The tangent of your answer is \\(1\\) (or approximately \\(1\\)) but note it should be in the range \\({{CT:0}}&lt;\\theta&lt;{{CT:1}}\\) as specified in the question.</div>"}, "on_false": {"scoremode": "=", "score": 0, "nextnode": -1, "answernote": "Result-1-F ", "feedback": ""}}]}], "qvnames": ["infinum", "n", "pim", "supre